WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,110
east

2
00:00:01,790 --> 00:00:04,430
We searched that place the day before yesterday and it was full of rocks.

3
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:05,790
Can't find anything at all

4
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:07,630
you let us go there

5
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:08,870
Isn't it a waste of effort?

6
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:12,700
Zhao Ya, can you do something good?

7
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:16,640
Don’t forget what Sister Weiwei arranged for you to do.

8
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:17,840
No sister Weiwei

9
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,600
Everyone has to move and starve to death, right?

10
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,840
If you have the ability, you can live on your own

11
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:28,100
Fang Xiaoman, you didn’t dig enough trees on Dongpo.

12
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:31,580
Even if you don’t have anything to eat, I’ll go too.

13
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,380
Why do you have any opinions?

14
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:38,430
No objection. No objection. I'll do it. Jiang Yue

15
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:40,310
The more you eat, the less firewood you have.

16
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:46,770
Go and keep an eye on Zhao Ya for me

17
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:49,570
I suspect she has been looking good these past two days.

18
00:00:50,010 --> 00:00:52,470
She ate something secretly. Find out.
